WEBVTT

00:08.020 --> 00:09.980
Hold him down!

00:10.280 --> 00:11.500
Hurry!

00:15.640 --> 00:19.340
Body temperature, heart rate, 
and blood pressure are rising.

00:19.340 --> 00:21.240
At this rate, his heart will...

00:21.960 --> 00:26.250
I knew a human wouldn't be able
to withstand heterophase transfer.

00:35.370 --> 00:38.260
You mustn't give up, everyone.

00:38.260 --> 00:40.160
Madam Ophelia.

00:47.280 --> 00:50.280
I'll return him to his senses 
by stimulating his brain.

02:48.420 --> 02:51.520
Ch-Chloe...

03:06.620 --> 03:09.230
Duplication Magic: Death Cancel.

03:10.040 --> 03:12.290
<b>Death Cancel</b>

03:12.940 --> 03:14.440
Duplication?

03:14.440 --> 03:17.790
What's going on? I...

03:21.070 --> 03:22.740
I am Anna.

03:22.740 --> 03:25.770
I infiltrated this nation with Doroka.

03:27.070 --> 03:28.560
It's all been part of the plan

03:28.990 --> 03:31.800
to resurrect Chloe the witch.

03:33.440 --> 03:35.400
We're getting you out of here.

03:36.890 --> 03:38.320
Who are you?

03:38.320 --> 03:39.690
Questions later.

03:40.430 --> 03:43.450
Send him, Madam Ophelia.

03:47.700 --> 03:48.620
What the...

03:58.440 --> 04:00.490
I'm sorry, Doroka.

04:14.920 --> 04:21.240
Thank you... for fighting for us.

04:27.310 --> 04:29.040
Who are you?

04:31.600 --> 04:34.590
I see. This is...

04:37.430 --> 04:40.540
Yes. This is the nation of witches.

04:49.590 --> 04:50.870
Look.

04:50.870 --> 04:52.350
They're ripening.

04:52.350 --> 04:53.110
Wow.

04:59.920 --> 05:03.110
Oh? You're already well enough 
to be up and about?

05:08.410 --> 05:09.300
Yeah.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.500
I'm glad.

05:11.500 --> 05:15.160
I'm sure Chloe would be sad 
if anything happened to you.

05:17.440 --> 05:20.120
You've met Chloe before?

05:20.120 --> 05:21.390
Of course.

05:21.390 --> 05:24.810
She was kind to us when we were little.

05:24.810 --> 05:26.380
We loved her.

05:27.530 --> 05:29.090
I see.

05:47.430 --> 05:50.000
Let me down. I can walk.

05:52.400 --> 05:55.680
Human influence can't 
touch this secluded land.

05:56.520 --> 06:02.040
The path you've taken to get here
is far beyond what you can imagine.

06:03.800 --> 06:07.180
Your body was placed under a lot of stress.

06:15.900 --> 06:17.070
Madam Ophelia.

06:19.400 --> 06:21.810
This season's harvest
has been bountiful as well.

06:25.150 --> 06:27.570
Witch of Revelation
\h\h\h\hOphelia Clementine

06:28.190 --> 06:29.900
What did you do to me?

06:31.920 --> 06:32.580
What the...

06:35.860 --> 06:38.600
I simply invited you here,

06:40.490 --> 06:43.330
Adonis, apprentice of Chloe.

06:43.720 --> 06:46.210
You knew Chloe, too?

06:46.720 --> 06:48.030
Of course.

06:48.440 --> 06:52.220
There isn't a witch 
in this nation who doesn't.

06:52.220 --> 06:58.290
She was stronger, smarter, more cheerful, 
and kinder than anyone else.

06:58.290 --> 07:05.240
Though she used ice, 
she radiated warmth like the sun.

07:06.280 --> 07:12.740
But she was cast out of the witches' nation.

07:12.740 --> 07:15.840
You mean <i>you</i> cast her out...

07:16.360 --> 07:19.740
for teaching magic to a human child.

07:22.800 --> 07:25.520
So Chloe told you about that.

07:26.410 --> 07:28.930
No, but I figured it out.

07:29.410 --> 07:31.450
I spent a lot of time with her, after all

07:34.350 --> 07:39.890
To witches, magic is 
irreplaceable. It's like our soul.

07:39.890 --> 07:47.400
It represents the friendship and devotion 
God granted us in order to lead humankind.

07:47.400 --> 07:51.900
It's not something a human 
should ever be taught.

07:51.900 --> 07:55.030
Chloe took on a human apprentice.

07:55.030 --> 07:58.160
We didn't understand her intentions,

07:58.160 --> 08:06.680
but at the time, every witch begged
her to abandon her apprentice and return.

08:06.680 --> 08:10.670
But she had only one thing to say to us.

08:11.080 --> 08:12.600
Sorry.

08:14.200 --> 08:16.590
That's certainly like her, isn't it?

08:17.010 --> 08:19.330
Have you finished reminiscing?

08:20.080 --> 08:21.280
Yes.

08:22.250 --> 08:25.140
You can have this back.

08:28.770 --> 08:31.520
My quill!

08:32.800 --> 08:34.570
You're in the way. Move.

08:39.640 --> 08:41.040
Give it back!

08:43.030 --> 08:49.830
A magic-imbued phoenix feather with adornments
 resembling waves and a red dragon's eye.

08:49.830 --> 08:52.040
Truly a masterpiece.

08:58.550 --> 09:03.290
Chloe made this for you, didn't she?

09:05.310 --> 09:07.600
Who else?

09:11.770 --> 09:13.970
You said your name is Ophelia?

09:15.520 --> 09:18.340
Can you bring Chloe back from the dead?

09:19.060 --> 09:21.490
Witches do not lie.

09:23.010 --> 09:24.250
I see.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.720
I see.

09:34.090 --> 09:36.860
What is that?

09:38.090 --> 09:41.890
This secluded land is 
beyond the reach of humans.

09:41.890 --> 09:44.000
It's a quiet celestial object.

09:44.490 --> 09:46.750
We arrived here ten years ago,

09:46.750 --> 09:50.800
and it became a place for witches 
to live peacefully once more.

09:51.300 --> 09:55.130
The new witches' nation, Lunamilia.

09:54.900 --> 09:57.360
Lunamilia

10:07.600 --> 10:11.630
Science revealed humankind's true nature.

10:11.630 --> 10:14.250
Perhaps God created a spherical world

10:14.250 --> 10:17.380
to keep them from seeing
 too far into the distance

10:17.380 --> 10:20.940
because he feared for their future.

10:25.680 --> 10:27.430
I won't abide it.

10:30.050 --> 10:34.980
These are gravestones 
for the witches that died.

10:43.530 --> 10:47.460
Humans are often constrained by expressions.

10:49.550 --> 10:52.320
"It's always darkest before the dawn."

10:52.320 --> 10:54.990
"The opposite of love is indifference."

10:54.990 --> 10:56.660
But in reality,

10:56.660 --> 11:04.580
the sky brightens as dawn approaches, 
and the opposite of love is obviously hate.

11:05.680 --> 11:08.840
"Witches will corrupt humankind."

11:09.560 --> 11:14.060
That is the expression 
the king of humans believed.

11:32.050 --> 11:35.370
This is a mito, a tree 
that produces witches.

11:33.130 --> 11:36.590
Mito

11:37.640 --> 11:40.090
You're a witch's apprentice. 
Have you seen one before?

11:40.560 --> 11:45.160
No, this is my first time
seeing one in person.

11:47.830 --> 11:51.260
Chloe didn't like to talk about her origins.

11:52.120 --> 11:55.360
Witches are unisex.

11:55.360 --> 11:58.360
Unlike humans, we do not have mating pairs.

11:59.060 --> 12:02.360
We receive life from these trees,

12:02.910 --> 12:06.150
as fruits containing the power of God.

12:06.150 --> 12:07.560
Mystical, isn't it?

12:08.480 --> 12:10.080
Whatever.

12:10.080 --> 12:14.290
This is the last surviving tree brought
here from the planet's surface.

12:14.290 --> 12:18.590
Humans burned all the other mito.

12:21.150 --> 12:26.600
Currently, this is the only tree 
that can birth and regenerate witches.

12:27.360 --> 12:28.970
Regenerate?

12:30.730 --> 12:32.030
Could it be?

12:36.030 --> 12:38.130
Is that...?

12:45.780 --> 12:47.040
Chloe.

12:47.490 --> 12:49.080
Is that Chloe?

12:50.310 --> 12:57.130
No, that is still merely 
a witch waiting to be born.

12:57.680 --> 13:01.760
She needs your strength to become Chloe.

13:02.300 --> 13:03.860
What do you mean?

13:09.060 --> 13:12.150
Magic is the act of giving 
an individual's thoughts

13:12.150 --> 13:15.140
a physical form in the material world.

13:17.080 --> 13:20.800
The Written-Style Summoning Magic you use...

13:20.800 --> 13:26.450
Depending on your proficiency, it can
be used to give form to any and all thoughts.

13:26.450 --> 13:29.030
In other words, it is versatile.

13:33.110 --> 13:35.770
Any and all thoughts...

13:36.650 --> 13:38.910
Take memory, for example.

13:38.910 --> 13:41.170
Memory is life itself.

13:41.630 --> 13:48.880
If you could seal your memories 
of Chloe within that fruit, then perhaps...

13:49.570 --> 13:52.640
I doubt I need to say more.

13:52.640 --> 13:57.400
Either way, you are the key 
to Chloe's resurrection.

13:59.890 --> 14:02.510
Please let me know when you're ready.

14:02.510 --> 14:04.900
We'll begin the ceremony then.

14:08.850 --> 14:10.260
Seriously?

14:14.120 --> 14:18.310
My magic will resurrect Chloe.

14:23.360 --> 14:26.790
You're the witch who cast 
that duplication spell.

14:27.760 --> 14:31.550
Don't you have something to say?

14:32.120 --> 14:34.960
What? You want me to thank you?

14:37.160 --> 14:38.800
You can't be serious.

14:39.130 --> 14:41.810
Doroka died for you.

14:42.670 --> 14:44.810
Not my problem.

14:46.660 --> 14:49.580
<i>You</i> planned all of this.

14:49.580 --> 14:52.070
Don't take your anger out on me.

14:54.000 --> 14:56.240
What? Hey!

14:56.570 --> 14:58.440
We're not done talking.

14:58.440 --> 14:59.960
Wait.

15:00.260 --> 15:02.930
Humans are so selfish.

15:02.930 --> 15:06.960
I bet you think you're lucky that
you can resurrect your beloved master

15:06.960 --> 15:10.760
as many times as you want 
with your magic and this tree.

15:12.550 --> 15:19.160
Why did we risk our lives 
for someone like you?

15:20.490 --> 15:22.200
Why?

15:22.860 --> 15:25.260
Isn't it so you could use Chloe?

15:25.730 --> 15:30.680
Isn't this the reason you saved me?

15:32.440 --> 15:34.360
What are you talking about?

15:34.360 --> 15:35.540
Don't play dumb.

15:39.670 --> 15:43.120
Adonis, listen to me.

15:43.740 --> 15:48.120
The witches are planning to use Chloe.

15:49.080 --> 15:56.960
You and Chloe need to flee 
the witches' nation.

16:01.010 --> 16:02.750
The witches' nation...

16:02.750 --> 16:06.640
You can live in extreme environments 
without protective gear.

16:06.640 --> 16:10.360
You did not need to build 
such a grandiose facility.

16:10.900 --> 16:15.160
This place is a cage 
for you to keep humans in.

16:16.960 --> 16:22.160
You'll kidnap human slaves 
and kids using your heterophase transfer,

16:22.160 --> 16:26.130
teach them Written-Style Summoning 
Magic, and make them fight.

16:26.610 --> 16:29.800
Witches are on the verge of extinction.

16:29.800 --> 16:32.170
You need an alternative 
source of soldiers to win.

16:32.790 --> 16:37.170
Chloe made this for you, didn't she?

16:37.440 --> 16:40.070
Only Chloe can make quills.

16:40.070 --> 16:43.750
That's why you want to 
resurrect her, isn't it?

16:45.440 --> 16:47.920
"Magic is the witches' soul."

16:49.910 --> 16:52.690
Yeah, right, you vixens.

16:57.640 --> 16:59.200
W-Wait.

16:59.200 --> 17:02.410
Wh-What are you going to do 
with that knowledge?

17:04.160 --> 17:06.050
Help us.

17:06.050 --> 17:09.590
I won't let Doroka's death be in vain.

17:11.080 --> 17:14.670
I'll still resurrect Chloe. 
That hasn't changed.

17:14.670 --> 17:15.520
What?

17:16.520 --> 17:20.810
I simply follow her will. That's all.

17:21.200 --> 17:24.800
But if Chloe rejects you...

17:26.310 --> 17:28.570
then the witches are my enemies, too.

17:29.080 --> 17:30.950
That's all there is to it.

17:42.800 --> 17:45.250
Let us begin.

17:56.840 --> 18:01.100
You were brought here by our will.

18:01.100 --> 18:07.090
But now, your will shall 
bring Chloe back to life.

18:08.040 --> 18:08.990
Yeah.

18:22.120 --> 18:24.360
Written-Style Summoning Magic:

18:34.910 --> 18:36.680
Nostalgic Memories.

18:36.380 --> 18:38.880
<b>Nostalgic Memories</b>

18:58.420 --> 18:59.640
Chloe...

19:04.670 --> 19:08.040
And that's Falulu, the witch's constellation.

19:08.420 --> 19:09.480
Look.

19:09.480 --> 19:11.440
When you connect that start and that star...

19:11.440 --> 19:12.540
See?

19:14.300 --> 19:16.140
Yeah, I know.

19:16.140 --> 19:21.050
It makes the beautiful face of the great
Falulu, who kind of looks like you.

19:21.050 --> 19:24.300
I've heard this a million times. 
You don't look anything like her.

19:24.300 --> 19:26.800
You didn't need to say that.

19:27.280 --> 19:31.060
And that's the Sea Dragon Constellation.

19:31.060 --> 19:36.140
That's the Last Phoenix, 
and that's Claris, the giant of knowledge.

19:36.810 --> 19:40.160
Wow, you memorized all of them?

19:40.160 --> 19:42.340
That's crazy. Are you a divine prodigy?

19:43.290 --> 19:46.820
Since I taught you, does that make me a god?

19:48.840 --> 19:53.760
And that's the Adonis Constellation, right?

19:54.470 --> 19:56.840
The one you came up with.

20:01.350 --> 20:03.080
Chloe, you jerk!

20:03.080 --> 20:04.740
I-I remember.

20:04.740 --> 20:09.040
You connect those rainbow-colored 
stars like this, right?

20:09.040 --> 20:11.960
That's totally wrong. It's over there.

20:11.960 --> 20:14.680
You really didn't put any thought into it.

20:14.680 --> 20:16.770
That's not true.

20:19.720 --> 20:23.860
<i>I wouldn't trade the time
I spent with you for anything.</i>

20:25.010 --> 20:29.970
<i>Thinking about it now feels like a dream.</i>

20:31.830 --> 20:34.620
Chloe. Chloe.

20:35.230 --> 20:37.980
You always leave your clothes lying around.

20:38.400 --> 20:41.770
I thought witches were 
supposed to be a noble species.

20:42.700 --> 20:46.240
Sorry, Adonis. You can leave those there.

20:46.920 --> 20:49.640
It's fine. I'll put them away.

20:59.570 --> 21:05.320
Adonis, you shouldn't spy on bathing ladies.

21:07.040 --> 21:09.140
You're such a precocious boy.

21:09.530 --> 21:11.280
What? No, I'm not.

21:11.930 --> 21:15.040
I-I was just worried you 
might've stayed in too long.

21:19.800 --> 21:22.800
I-I'm gonna go stand watch.

21:25.040 --> 21:31.950
I know we haven't bathed in a while, but our 
pursuers might show up, so don't take too long.

21:34.400 --> 21:35.800
Thank you.

21:37.440 --> 21:39.240
For staying with me.

21:40.800 --> 21:44.160
If you hadn't been here, I...

21:45.490 --> 21:50.140
I can't live in this world alone.

21:57.400 --> 22:00.090
Me neither, Chloe.

22:16.150 --> 22:18.920
I love you, so...

22:23.610 --> 22:25.290
Thank you.
